              "description": "How a WHO Digital Transformation Handbook (DTH) is produced, from sources to publication, in the seven stages and milestones of dth-authoring.bpmn — and the rules the diagram cannot carry: which review sheet each stage uses, the DAK kinds every DTH is written in, and how a term is deprecated. Read before starting a new DTH, before moving one to its next stage, and before setting up its feedback or public-comment sheet.",
